description: Repository layer boundaries with ApiService-only access
globs: "lib/**/repositories/**/*.dart,lib/**/repository/**/*.dart,lib/core/services/api_service.dart,**/*_bloc.dart"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Repository Layer Boundaries

- Repositories must only call `ApiService` for network access.
- Repository methods should return raw response/data mapping only.
- Do not place business logic, decision trees, validation, orchestration, or UI rules in repositories.
- Do not call `ApiService` directly from BLoC, UI, or widgets.
- Keep all business/decision logic in BLoC only.
- If behavior depends on state, user flow, retries, or conditional branching, implement it in BLoC.
- Do not branch on `response_type` inside repositories; BLoC handles `response_type` and state emission.
